#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Hestia is a modern WordPress theme for professionals. It fits creative business, small businesses (restaurants, wedding planners, sport/medical shops), startups, corporate businesses, online agencies and firms, portfolios, ecommerce (WooCommerce), and freelancers. It has a multipurpose one-page design, widgetized footer, blog/news page and a clean look, is compatible with: Flat Parallax Slider, Photo Gallery, Travel Map and Elementor Page Builder . The theme is responsive, WPML, Retina ready, SEO friendly, and uses Material Kit for design."
msgstr "Hestia adalah tema WordPress modern yang profesional. Cocok untuk bisnis kreatif, bisnis kecil (restoran, acara pernikahan, olahraga/toko obat-obatan), bisnis awal, bisnis besar, agen online, portofolio, ecommerce (WooCommerce), dan freelance. Tema ini memiliki desain one-page yang serba guna, bagian footer di widgetkan, halaman blog/kabar berita dan enak dilihat, cocok untuk: Parallax Slider, Photo Gallery, Travel Map dan Elementor Page Builder. Tema ini sangat responsif, WPML, Retina, SEO bersahabat, dan menggunakan Material Kit untuk desainnya."

